OL,3,GNEWSAKarl Bushby to receive honorary   
OL,4,Adegree                                 
OL,6,FBritish adventurer Karl Bushby is to be
OL,7,Fawarded an honorary university degree. 
OL,9,FLast month, the former paratrooper     
OL,10,Fcompleted a 31,000-mile (50,000km)     
OL,11,Fjourney from South America to Hull.    
OL,13,FThe University of Hull said it had     
OL,14,Fchosen to honour "four inspirational   
OL,15,Ffigures" whose "courage, creativity and
OL,16,Fcommitment have transformed lives and  
OL,17,Fpushed the boundaries of the possible".
