OL,3,GNEWSAKarl Bushby to receive honorary   
OL,4,Adegree                                 
OL,6,FHonorary degrees will also be conferred
OL,7,Fon celebrated author Prof Joanna Nadin,
OL,8,Fleading voice in palliative care Prof  
OL,9,FIlora Baroness Finlay of Llandaff, and 
OL,10,Fbusiness leader Jacky Bowes.           
